Build an aurora/fluid GLSL background hero for {{CLIENT_NAME}}.

AURORA SHADER (Three.js OrthographicCamera):
```glsl
for(int i=0;i<5;i++){
  float fi=float(i);
  vec2 uv2=uv+vec2(0.,fbm(uv*1.4+uTime*(0.07+fi*.015)+fi*2.3)-.5)*.3;
  float y=uv2.y-(.3+fi*.07);
  float stripe=smoothstep(.025,.0,abs(y+sin(uv2.x*3.+uTime*.5+fi)*0.12));
  vec3 rc=mix(vec3(.1,.9,.5),vec3(.05,.3,.95),fi/4.5);
  col+=rc*stripe*(1.2-fi*.15)*2.5;
}
```
